{"id":"wb-5-123","name":"悬泉置遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"悬泉置遗址","text":"悬泉置遗址是中国甘肃省酒泉市敦煌市莫高镇新店台村的一处丝绸之路大型驿站遗址，其全称为“敦煌郡效谷县悬泉置”，驿站的主官为啬夫，驿站公务人员有37人左右，一次最大可接待500多人。驿站距离敦煌市64公里，距离瓜州60公里，以南靠近祁连山的火焰山。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%82%AC%E6%B3%89%E7%BD%AE%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":86857847,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86857847","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/70d10d06f0d2838149ec978b.png","title":"悬泉置位置简图.png","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%82%AC%E6%B3%89%E7%BD%AE%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E7%AE%80%E5%9B%BE.png","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bf/%E6%82%AC%E6%B3%89%E7%BD%AE%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E7%AE%80%E5%9B%BE.png?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"苏你妹~","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​悬泉置在甘肃省的位置简图","width":320,"height":240}}